            "file_text": "# Sketchpad File Input Investigation\n\n## Problem\nPlaywright tests can't find the file input element with id \"semio.sketchpad.app.home.importKit\" even though it exists in the source code.\n\n## Root Cause Identified: Controlled Value on File Input\n\nThe `Input` component is attempting to control the `value` prop for ALL input types, including `type=\"file\"`. This is a React/browser security restriction that causes issues.\n\n### Files Involved:\n1. **[semio/js/sketchpad/Home.tsx](semio/js/sketchpad/Home.tsx#L671)** - Uses Input component with `type=\"file\"`\n2. **[semio/js/sketchpad/elements.tsx](semio/js/sketchpad/elements.tsx#L2365-L2390)** - Input component that tries to control value\n\n### The Bug:\n\nIn [elements.tsx line 2365-2390](semio/js/sketchpad/elements.tsx#L2365-L2390):\n```tsx\nconst inputElement = (\n  \u003cdiv style={{ opacity: shouldFade ? 0 : 1, transition: \"opacity 150ms\" }}\u003e\n    \u003cinput\n      type={type}\n      ...\n      value={inputValue}  // \u003c-- THIS BREAKS FOR FILE INPUTS\n      onChange={handleChange}\n      ...\n    /\u003e\n  \u003c/div\u003e\n);\n```\n\nFor file inputs, `value` should never be set because:\n- React cannot read file input values (security restriction)\n- React cannot set file input values (security restriction)\n- This causes a React error that prevents the element from rendering correctly\n\n### Why Test Fails:\n1. Input component tries to render with `value={inputValue}` for file input\n2. React throws an error because file inputs cannot be controlled via value\n3. Element doesn't render in DOM or is partially detached\n4. Playwright's `toBeAttached()` check fails with timeout\n\n### HomeDropZone Structure:\n- **File**: [semio/js/sketchpad/Home.tsx](semio/js/sketchpad/Home.tsx#L574)\n- **Line**: 574-695\n- The Input component is wrapped in a div with drag-drop handlers\n- className=\"hidden\" hides it visually but shouldn't affect DOM attachment\n\n### Dev Server Config:\n- **Script**: `dev:sketchpad` in [package.json](semio/js/package.json#L27)\n- **Command**: `vite --port 5173 --host 0.0.0.0`\n- **Entry point**: [site.tsx](semio/js/site.tsx) mounts Sketchpad into root div\n- **Router**: Enabled via [Sketchpad.tsx](semio/js/sketchpad/Sketchpad.tsx#L79-L80) with BrowserRouter/MemoryRouter\n\n### Component Routes:\n- File input is in HomeDropZone → Home.tsx component (via [homeConfig](semio/js/sketchpad/Home.tsx#L1780-1800))\n- Home is registered as app in [site.tsx](semio/js/site.tsx#L37)\n\n## Solution Required:\nModify Input component to NOT control value for file inputs. File inputs must remain uncontrolled.\n"
